Hanson Fitness Center is opening its {{32}} location on Park Avenue this Saturday. To celebrate, we are offering new members 50 percent off their first three months. {{33}}

Our modern facility features the latest exercise equipment, a heated indoor pool, and group classes {{34}} yoga, cycling, and dance. Personal trainers are also available to help you reach your fitness goals.

Visit us this weekend for a free tour. Space in group classes is limited, so we recommend {{35}} early.
